 "name_en": "Foreign Currency Risk Management – Group Ledger IFRS (1X9)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Foreign Currency Risk Management – Group Ledger IFRS (1X9)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio284bffc2d00c441091ef5e536265e4c0\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio284bffc2d00c441091ef5e536265e4c0__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">By activating parallel valuation for foreign currency risk management, you can use an additional valuation area besides your operational valuation area according to International Financial Reporting Standards (IFRS 9) phase I (Classification and Measurement).</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio284bffc2d00c441091ef5e536265e4c0__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Generate and post accounting postings</li>\n      </ul>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform valuation of financial Instruments</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Post realized profit and loss</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio284bffc2d00c441091ef5e536265e4c0__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Generate all postings for the general ledger</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Update the general ledger according to IFRS 9 phase I (Classification and Measurement)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Process the valuation of transactions and position</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Automate the month-end accounting processing</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>外币风险管理 – 集团分类账 IFRS (1X9)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio284bffc2d00c441091ef5e536265e4c0\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio284bffc2d00c441091ef5e536265e4c0__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">通过激活外币风险管理的并行评估，可以使用除运营评估以外的附加评估范围，基于国际财务报告标准 (IFRS 9) 阶段 I（分类和度量）。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio284bffc2d00c441091ef5e536265e4c0__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">生成并过账会计过账</li>\n      </ul>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">执行金融工具评估</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">过账已实现的损益</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio284bffc2d00c441091ef5e536265e4c0__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">生成总账的所有过账</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">根据 IFRS 9 阶段 I（分类和度量）更新总账</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">处理交易和头寸评估</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">自动化月末会计处理</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
